        "It might therefore come as a surprise when Luk\u00e1cs in Tailism states that the purpose of History and Class Consciousness was to demonstrate \u2018that the organisation and tactics of Bolshevism are the only possible consequence of Marxism\u2019. In my view, however, this should already be abundantly clear from History and Class Consciousness.",
